  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> ;  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math> ;  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>  ;  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow